OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman's body
OL,4,Afound in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman's
OL,7,Fbody was discovered at an address in
OL,8,FStaffordshire.
OL,10,FThe woman, who was in her 30s, was
OL,11,Fdiscovered at Holts Lane in Tutbury at
OL,12,Fabout 11:45 BST on Saturday morning,
OL,13,Faccording to Staffordshire Police.
OL,15,FDespite the best efforts of paramedics,
OL,16,Fshe was confirmed dead at the scene.
OL,17,FHer next of kin have been informed and
OL,18,Fwill be supported by specially-trained
OL,19,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
