OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman's body
OL,4,Afound in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said a 41-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Tutbury had been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of manslaughter and is in
OL,9,Fcustody for questioning.
